## Pull request overview

This PR fixes dashboard widget config live preview synchronization and scatter chart type rendering issues. When users edited widget configuration in the right-side panel (data source, categoryField, valueField, aggregate), changes were not reflected in real-time on the left dashboard preview. Additionally, switching widget type to `scatter` caused rendering errors.

**Changes:**
- Added live preview state management to `DashboardWithConfig` using internal `liveSchema` state + `configVersion` counter pattern
- Added `scatter` to chart type conditions in `DashboardRenderer` and `DashboardGridLayout` 
- Implemented widget-level field fallbacks (`widget.categoryField || options.xField`) to bridge config panel edits with rendering logic
- Added object-chart/data-table construction for newly created widgets without explicit data providers
- Added 7 new tests covering scatter chart rendering, field fallbacks, and object construction scenarios

### Reviewed changes

Copilot reviewed 6 out of 6 changed files in this pull request and generated 3 comments.

