| `packages/plugin-dashboard/src/DashboardRenderer.tsx` | Adds scatter to chart type condition, implements widget-level field fallbacks (categoryField/valueField), and adds object-chart/data-table construction for widgets without data providers |
| `packages/plugin-dashboard/src/DashboardGridLayout.tsx` | Same fixes as DashboardRenderer (scatter support, field fallbacks, object construction) but for grid layout mode |
| `packages/plugin-dashboard/src/__tests__/DashboardWithConfig.test.tsx` | Adds test for live preview (renders without error, but doesn't verify actual preview functionality) |
| `packages/plugin-dashboard/src/__tests__/DashboardRenderer.widgetData.test.tsx` | Adds 7 comprehensive tests for scatter chart rendering, field fallback priority, and object-chart/data-table construction from widget-level fields |
